<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Teljoy warns on Servgro unbundling.</title>
<headline>Teljoy warns on Servgro unbundling.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teljoy Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that the unbundling of its controlling shareholder Servgro International was continuing.</p>
<p>Teljoy said it was unlikely the second phase of the unbundling of Servgro would be announced before June 30.</p>
<p>The second phase of the unbundling will result in either the distribution of proceeds derived from the disposal of Servgro shares in Teljoy or the distribution of Teljoy shares to Servgro's shareholders.</p>
<p>Shareholders are advised to continue to exercise caution in their dealings until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
